    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Continuity you are sent to a planet similar to earth that is plagued with evil and creatures that seek your blood. Your mission is to clear this world of plague and take over this planet to help fix overpopulation on earth. <br><br>Explore this vast world full of biomes and structures to get new gear and materials. Find new enemies in every area you go to. At the start of your adventure you land on this unknown planet &quot;Athea 24Z7&quot; sent to be the hero of earth and cleanse this world of evil. Upon loading into a world you must choose your class which will determine the skills you can unlock as well as the weapons and artifacts you can use. Fight off against bosses to unlock new stages of the story and find new enemies to fight.<br><br>You will soon realize the truths about your mission and the story of this unknown world. You aren't as alone as you thought you were, hero.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Continuity you are sent to a planet similar to earth that is plagued with evil and creatures that seek your blood. Your mission is to clear this world of plague and take over this planet to help fix overpopulation on earth. <br><br>Explore this vast world full of biomes and structures to get new gear and materials. Find new enemies in every area you go to. At the start of your adventure you land on this unknown planet &quot;Athea 24Z7&quot; sent to be the hero of earth and cleanse this world of evil. Upon loading into a world you must choose your class which will determine the skills you can unlock as well as the weapons and artifacts you can use. Fight off against bosses to unlock new stages of the story and find new enemies to fight.<br><br>You will soon realize the truths about your mission and the story of this unknown world. You aren't as alone as you thought you were, hero.</p>",
    "short_description": "Continuity is a 2D PvE story game with uniquely generated worlds to explore. Pick a class and level up to unlock new skills along your adventure through the danger filled world. Fight against monsters and bosses or explore to grow your strength and get better gear, specific to your class.",
